-- Passage wg8-writing-with-evidence-p04
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0c42a82c-b490-5e05-a750-5b0850d2b59a', 'wg8-writing-with-evidence-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: The Underpass Mural$q$, $q$(1) The article "Painting the Underpass" by Nadia Fofanah tells how a group of neighbors turned a gray tunnel into a bright mural. (2) Fofanah suggests that the mural changed the underpass from a place people avoided into a place they gathered. (3) Before the project, Fofanah writes, "most walkers crossed the busy road above rather than use the tunnel." (4) ____ the mural was finished, a neighborhood group began holding a small Saturday market inside the tunnel. (5) The mural uses blue, orange and green paint. (6) Fofanah also reports that the city counted three times as many walkers in the tunnel the following spring.

(7) The people who painted it also changed. (8) Fofanah describes retired teacher Hamid Saleh, who had never met most of his neighbors before he picked up a brush. (9) By the end, he knew forty of them by name. (10) This shows that the project built friendships as well as a mural.

(11) Overall, the article shows that art can make a neighborhood better.$q$, 'draft')
