  ('b1278400-e786-5239-af43-0408d3e369f2', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Sentence 10 needs more explanation. Which sentence, added after it, best explains how the evidence supports the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He was one of the students that Abara interviewed for the article.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-fact"},{"text":"Like the article, he shows that students gave something up but gained closer ties with classmates.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Tobias is in eighth grade, just like me, so I understand how he feels.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"personal-connection"},{"text":"Tobias probably wants the school to bring phones back next year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Like the article, he shows that students gave something up but gained closer ties with classmates.$q$, $q$Tobias missed scores but liked knowing his tablemates, and the choice "Like the article, he shows" explains how that matches the claim of giving something up and gaining connection. Nothing in the draft says what Tobias wants next year, so that choice is a guess.$q$, 'draft', 'a9580e23-ac5e-5950-87da-7296db5e38be')
