   $q$How does sentence 6 support sentence 5?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It introduces a new topic about why solitary bees rarely sting people.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-topic"},{"text":"It repeats sentence 5 using different words without adding anything.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-repetition"},{"text":"It gives a contrasting fact that weakens the point made in sentence 5.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"It explains the reason behind the fact in sentence 5, showing why a mason bee pollinates so well.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains the reason behind the fact in sentence 5, showing why a mason bee pollinates so well.$q$, $q$Sentence 6 begins "This is because" and explains how loose pollen lets a mason bee pollinate more flowers. It agrees with sentence 5 rather than weakening it.$q$, 'draft', '362be4b9-3af6-5c86-8e57-b3f540a62e51')
