   $q$The writer wants to add evidence that supports the claim in sentence 10. Which detail from the article would be most effective?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Park notes that the class's bee hotel cost under ten dollars and took one afternoon to build.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Park notes that most solitary bees are busiest during the warm weeks of spring.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Park notes that the class later used a microscope to study the wings of the bees.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Park notes that some solitary bees are smaller than a single grain of rice.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Park notes that the class's bee hotel cost under ten dollars and took one afternoon to build.$q$, $q$Sentence 10 says simple projects can help, and a cheap bee hotel built in one afternoon proves the project was simple. Studying bee wings with a microscope is about the class, not about how easy it is to help the bees.$q$, 'draft', '362be4b9-3af6-5c86-8e57-b3f540a62e51')
