   $q$Why does the writer place sentence 4 right after sentence 3?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To explain why the bus needed to be painted bright colors.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"To prove that students liked using telescopes more than microscopes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To show that the county schools had better tools than the bus did.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-contrast"},{"text":"To contrast the schools' one microscope with the bus's equipment, supporting the claim in sentence 2.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To contrast the schools' one microscope with the bus's equipment, supporting the claim in sentence 2.$q$, $q$Sentence 4 begins "by contrast" and sets twelve microscopes against the schools' single one, showing the bus offered something new. That comparison shows the bus had more tools, not fewer.$q$, 'draft', 'f10969c8-3da3-54c7-a142-f56f2f62264c')
